import{_ as n,o as i,c as o,a2 as t}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const g=JSON.parse(`{"title":"Entry 942 | Anti-Predation Heavenly-Dao Rules · Rule 8 | Strong Ones Do Not Ascend Alone","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 942 | Anti-Predation Heavenly-Dao Rules · Rule 8 | Strong Ones Do Not Ascend Alone","no":942,"module":5,"tags":["Heavenly-Dao Rule","Rule 8","Collective Ascension","No Solo Ascension","Strong-One Responsibility"],"related":["17-Plane-Sovereign Strong-One Standards","904-Collective-Ascension Obligation","919-Transcendent One's Perpetual-Construction Obligation"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0942_模块5-规则八-强者不独自飞升.md","filePath":"en/0942_模块5-规则八-强者不独自飞升.md"}`),a={name:"en/0942_模块5-规则八-强者不独自飞升.md"};function s(r,e,l,u,c,h){return i(),o("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[t('<h1 id="entry-942-anti-predation-heavenly-dao-rules-·-rule-8-strong-ones-do-not-ascend-alone" tabindex="-1">Entry 942 | Anti-Predation Heavenly-Dao Rules · Rule 8 | Strong Ones Do Not Ascend Alone <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-942-anti-predation-heavenly-dao-rules-·-rule-8-strong-ones-do-not-ascend-alone" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 942 | Anti-Predation Heavenly-Dao Rules · Rule 8 | Strong Ones Do Not Ascend Alone&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 5 · Civilization Final-Finalization Canonical Entries | Benchmark base: Document 17 | Series: Complete Collection of Anti-Predation Heavenly-Dao Rules</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-one-person-flying-up-equals-leaving-the-whole-civilization-in-place" tabindex="-1">Introduction: one person flying up equals leaving the whole civilization in place <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-one-person-flying-up-equals-leaving-the-whole-civilization-in-place" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: one person flying up equals leaving the whole civilization in place&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The old cosmos&#39;s most chilling scene is the strong one surviving his tribulation, tearing open the void, ascending alone, leaving a realm&#39;s beings still struggling in the mire. Ascension is beautified as &quot;personal perfection,&quot; yet no one asks: that step he stepped on, was it built by others? Heavenly-Dao Rule 8 judges this picture illegal: in Heng Yuan Zhou, strong ones do not ascend alone. The higher your realm, the how-high-you-can-go is deeply bound with how-deep-Myriad-Ranks-walk — if you want to fly, you must carry everyone up together.</p><p>The six top-level axioms erupt centrally here: the collective-ascension axiom is this rule&#39;s body, directly requiring &quot;strong ones do not ascend alone, lifting Myriad Ranks forward together&quot;; the republican axiom of Myriad Races decides the scope of &quot;everyone&quot;; the anti-predation axiom negates &quot;using Myriad Ranks as fuel to climb alone to heaven&quot;; the causal self-discipline axiom brings the strong one&#39;s ascension impulse into reporting and assessment; the law-first axiom lets &quot;ascension conditions&quot; be defined first by law, with no exceptions for individual strong-one achievement.</p><p>It must further point out the newly added Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing and layabouts retain a floor basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes may superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. This axiom rewrites predation&#39;s meaning at the root: old-cosmos resources and Dao were finite, so predation involution was forced; in Heng Yuan Zhou everyone inherently possesses infinite origin, and predation loses meaning. What this Heavenly-Dao rule establishes is precisely the law guardrail of this new order of &quot;infinite origin, predation meaningless.&quot;</p><h2 id="i-rule-content-collective-conditions-of-ascension" tabindex="-1">I. Rule Content: Collective Conditions of Ascension <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-rule-content-collective-conditions-of-ascension" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Rule Content: Collective Conditions of Ascension&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Rule 8 stipulates any strong one who wants to break through to plane sovereign or even Origin Realm, Multiverse Realm, Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm must simultaneously satisfy:</p><ol><li><strong>Myriad-Ranks-progress condition</strong>: his plane/civilization&#39;s Myriad-Ranks 99% coverage (Rule 6) has met standard, and the collective average realm is no lower than some baseline;</li><li><strong>Feedback record condition</strong>: the strong one&#39;s past contributions of increment development, Dao-text openness, and discipleship records are network-verified as positive;</li><li><strong>No-solo-run condition</strong>: during breakthrough he may not close his connection to the anchor network, nor take away an exclusive &quot;ascension channel&quot; for private use;</li><li><strong>Return-duty condition</strong>: after ascension he must still perform Entry 919&#39;s Transcendent perpetual-construction duty, not leave forever.</li></ol><p>Missing any of the four, breakthrough certification is not granted.</p><h2 id="ii-jurisprudential-basis" tabindex="-1">II. Jurisprudential Basis <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-jurisprudential-basis" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Jurisprudential Basis&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Causal-binding argument</strong>: the strong one&#39;s every achievement arises within Myriad Ranks&#39; causal web; severing the network and ascending alone equals pulling away civilization&#39;s load-bearing wall, and the plane left behind necessarily convulses;</li><li><strong>Efficiency argument</strong>: plane-sovereign strong-one four-dimensional assessment (Entry 911) has already proven, under the structure of force 40 / heart-nature 25 / contribution 20 / responsibility 15, strong ones only pursuing force are eventually backlashed by missing responsibility;</li><li><strong>Civilizational-closed-loop argument</strong>: what civilizational finalization requires is whole-system closure, not individual strong-one escape; one person ascending while civilization spins in place is loop failure.</li></ul><h2 id="iii-execution-mechanism" tabindex="-1">III. Execution Mechanism <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-execution-mechanism" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Execution Mechanism&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>The Alaya Network generates an &quot;ascension-condition dashboard&quot; for each candidate strong one, publicly showing how far he is short of the four standards;</li><li>Breakthrough certification is double-verified by the Symbiotic Court and Anchor Supervisory Committee jointly; missing any one is not approved;</li><li>For high-position strong ones with deliberate &quot;solo-run&quot; tendency, the network automatically freezes their exclusive channel, guiding them into the &quot;lift Myriad Ranks&quot; route;</li><li>A &quot;lead-the-group ascension&quot; technical path is provided: when a strong one breaks through, he may include fellow disciples and his civilization&#39;s synchronized advancement in the breakthrough project, and instead gains law amplification.</li></ul><h2 id="iv-consequences-of-violation" tabindex="-1">IV. Consequences of Violation <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-consequences-of-violation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Consequences of Violation&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Light</strong>: only minding personal progress, neglecting feedback, dashboard long red, public warning;</li><li><strong>Medium</strong>: artificially suppressing Myriad-Ranks progress to satisfy personal ascension conditions (e.g., monopolizing Dao texts to slow others), permissions frozen, enters conversion program;</li><li><strong>Heavy</strong>: forcibly severing the network, opening a private ascension channel to escape, is network-wide pursued by the anchor network, stripped of all anchor benefits, handled per the causal self-discipline axiom.</li></ul><p>Heavenly-Dao rules do not punish &quot;flying fast,&quot; only &quot;leaving people behind.&quot;</p><h2 id="v-supervising-subjects" tabindex="-1">V. Supervising Subjects <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-supervising-subjects" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Supervising Subjects&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision&#39;s ascension-condition dashboard is the first layer; the Anchor Supervisory Committee re-reviews breakthrough applications as the second layer; the Symbiotic Court adjudicates &quot;solo-run&quot; cases as the third layer; Myriad Ranks&#39; clans have the right to comment on whether their own ascending candidate has fulfilled the lifting duty as the fourth layer.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: experience and law insights carried away by solo ascension, if not returned, perish with the individual; this is civilizational-level waste</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: negating &quot;using Myriad Ranks as stepping stones to climb alone to heaven&quot;; predation&#39;s most powerful scene is legislatively forbidden; under Axiom 6 everyone inherently possesses basic infinite power, and finite-resource predation loses meaning at the root</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo-type protagonists attain Dao alone, relatives bask in the halo; Heng Yuan Zhou strong ones who do not lift Myriad Ranks cannot even enter the breakthrough door</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: ascension conditions are bound to 99% coverage, forcing strong ones to direct resources toward the weakest clans</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: the lead-the-group ascension path reserves a &quot;clan synchronized leap&quot; interface for the Multiverse Realm and Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Ascension is not an escape pod, but civilization&#39;s elevator. Rule 8 declares: the elevator must carry everyone up to count as reaching the top.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/17-位面至高强者标准.html">Entry 17 · Plane-Sovereign Strong-One Standards</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/904_模块5-第三条-集体升维义务.html">Entry 904 · Collective-Ascension Obligation</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/919_模块5-第十八条-超脱者永动建设义务.html">Entry 919 · Transcendent One&#39;s Perpetual-Construction Obligation</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/943_模块5-规则九-抬着万族一起进化.html">Entry 943 · Rule 9 Lift Myriad Ranks Up Together to Evolve</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',25)])])}const p=n(a,[["render",s]]);export{g as __pageData,p as default};
